# Blux app id — sign in at https://dashboard.blux.cc, create an app, copy its id.
# Blux validates the appId against its API; login/signing refuse to run with an
# invalid one, so a real dashboard app id is required.
VITE_BLUX_APP_ID=

# OPTIONAL — the swap card is keyless (it talks to the Soroswap router
# contract directly). A key (free: api.soroswap.finance/register) is only
# needed for the API-based maintenance scripts in packages/shared/scripts
# (faucet minting, pool seeding after a testnet reset).
VITE_SOROSWAP_API_KEY=
